gnome-shell-extension-lock-screen-suite (2.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Replace the centered animated weather icon with a full-screen ambient
    atmosphere (rain, snow, storms, fog, clouds, clear day/night) on every
    monitor, plus a slim text weather line with daily high/low. Sky-aware:
    stars, moon, sun glow and clouds anchor to sky detected in the lock
    wallpaper, and bright day wallpapers dim adaptively at night.

 -- Norvi <apt@globalentry.systems>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

